{"title":"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 28","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Five points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/6/54666818ebcd515974999b5dbd52fc1324902e7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O,A,B,C,D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"103\" height=\"16\" /> are taken in order on a straight line with distances <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/9/00999706a86443a2bb945a919622798d49e2b88b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$OA = a$\" width=\"62\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/d/20d847270eb84ce26340a3996ac7e8892f3c04a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$OB = b$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/1/b715618ac445bbdcae5b706308093a85a7c85f30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$OC = c$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/8/1287ca808182e36e71801a1a2ac163ed614c7344.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$OD = d$\" width=\"63\" height=\"12\" />.  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is a point on the line between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/2/972ae68b012c8e07a445b02d96e48b4e390d5e9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AP: PD = BP: PC$\" width=\"169\" height=\"13\" />.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/d/25dcc9ecb8e7c6fb80766c186721353e6c3dc398.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$OP$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/5/f5503ba69dcde2540b37bd2698fc96c76d571b7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)} \\frac {b^2 - bc}{a - b + c - d} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)} \\frac {ac - bd}{a - b + c - d} \\\\  \\textbf{(C)} - \\frac {bd + ac}{a - b + c - d} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)} \\frac {bc + ad}{a + b + c + d} \\qquad \\textbf{(E)} \\frac {ac - bd}{a + b + c + d}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"488\" height=\"81\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Letting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/6/6d62d84b7d38b0eb0381900a565d0c65662e00b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=OP$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"65\" height=\"14\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/8/8d84341356c99c3dc245c0dad6d381b7f0eabf39.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{AP}{PD}=\\frac{BP}{PC}\\]\" width=\"87\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/9/6799c5ded4b34d322ee37b9801adf476d4cbdcd3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{x-a}{d-x}=\\frac{x-b}{c-x}\\]\" width=\"111\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/a/16a72d244c8d789a09723994d87e2d86a08816dd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{x-a}{d-x}=\\frac{b-x}{x-c}\\]\" width=\"111\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/6/656f26fde5a8624185937cd753ca5e646f5aa3a7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x-a)(x-c)=(b-x)(d-x)\\]\" width=\"243\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/9/c3976e4ddf20c5666422b6e7f8dcd5a684819840.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2-ax-cx+ac=x^2-bx-dx+bd\\]\" width=\"304\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/b/e1bb723ea00a9b518d522da65865c9d7b5cc40ab.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[bx+dx-ax-cx=bd-ac\\]\" width=\"223\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/6/ca6672df93cccd8ce263b2543306bed3c21fc7e3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x(b+d-a-c)=bd-ac\\]\" width=\"206\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/f/d9fb858ee93938cdc1569a230879c796782cde75.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=\\frac{bd-ac}{b+d-a-c}\\]\" width=\"137\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/1/821df9e35b10e02306f6d702a3e2b472f59c56de.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=\\frac{ac-bd}{a-b+c-d}\\]\" width=\"137\" height=\"39\" />\nThus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/c/13c3218ca790f4eac4048f34f68433655b19e1f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME\" title=\"1966 AHSME\">1966 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?tit